  "description_text": "This beautiful home located in the heart of Bridgeport village neighborhood has many high end updates and is the perfect home for entertaining. The home has hardwood floors though out. The first floor was renovated and has a completely open floor plan. The kitchen has custom cabinets, high end stainless steel appliances, and quartz counter tops. The lower level has a full custom bar, theater, pool table, gym and a four person infrared sauna. The second floor features two bedrooms that share a jack and jill bathroom. The large primary bedroom has tons of sunlight and has his and her custom closets. The forth floor features one bedroom, full bathroom, a walk in closet that has a private balcony. There's a huge recreation room with a wet bar and lots of cabinets. This leads out to a large deck that over looks the downtown sky line. Both decks have trex flooring. The backyard is your own private oasis. The two car garage has epoxy flooring and a \"party door,\" that gives you more indoor outdoor space. The location is key. You're close to the river walk, the Bridgeport and Zhau B art centers, restaurants, bars, grocery stores, and the newly remodeled Ramova theater. Don't miss out on this amazing property!!",
